00:47:53,162 --> 00:47:55,872
Uh, hey, I told you
I would get you up there,

1224
00:47:55,873 --> 00:47:58,333
and I promise I'm not leaving
until you're back

1225
00:47:58,334 --> 00:48:00,001
and sent packing.

1226
00:48:00,002 --> 00:48:01,669
- Robby, buddy,
you got me to come in,

1227
00:48:01,670 --> 00:48:03,338
got me to take my tests.

1228
00:48:03,339 --> 00:48:05,548
You don't got to babysit me.
That's why I have a nurse.

1229
00:48:05,549 --> 00:48:07,717
What's your name, sweetheart?
- Nurse Vivi, sir.

1230
00:48:07,718 --> 00:48:09,677
- That's what I have
the lovely Nurse Vivi here for.

1231
00:48:09,678 --> 00:48:11,679
- This will not take very long.

1232
00:48:11,680 --> 00:48:14,015
- [laughs]
Where have I heard that before?

1233
00:48:14,016 --> 00:48:15,517
- Hey.

1234
00:48:15,518 --> 00:48:17,936
So, uh, this is it, huh?

1235
00:48:17,937 --> 00:48:20,105
- Uh, yeah.

1236
00:48:20,106 --> 00:48:22,358
Don't let the place burn down.

1237
00:48:24,360 --> 00:48:26,152
- You know...

1238
00:48:26,153 --> 00:48:29,072
in a previous life, I had a lot
of friends who liked to see

1239
00:48:29,073 --> 00:48:31,366
how close the edge was...

1240
00:48:31,367 --> 00:48:34,744
as if it was a challenge
they were called to meet.

1241
00:48:34,745 --> 00:48:37,790
Trouble is,
they all inevitably found it.

1242
00:48:40,167 --> 00:48:41,627
- Okay.

1243
00:48:44,004 --> 00:48:45,380
- I'm just picking up

1244
00:48:45,381 --> 00:48:47,340
on a weird vibe
from you today is all.

1245
00:48:47,341 --> 00:48:51,387
- [laughing] Yeah, well,
it's been a weird day.

1246
00:48:56,392 --> 00:48:58,393
- You leaving?
- Uh, yeah.

1247
00:48:58,394 --> 00:49:01,354
My shift is over, and I ain't
getting paid to be here.

1248
00:49:01,355 --> 00:49:03,565
Quite literally the opposite,
in fact.

1249
00:49:03,566 --> 00:49:05,358
- Well, I don't know
if you noticed,

1250
00:49:05,359 --> 00:49:08,236
but we're sort of, uh,
in disaster mode here still.

1251
00:49:08,237 --> 00:49:10,823
We put in the extra time
if we're needed.

1252
00:49:12,783 --> 00:49:17,328
- You know 62% of ED docs
report suffering from burnout?

1253
00:49:17,329 --> 00:49:19,247
- Painfully aware.
- Mm.

1254
00:49:19,248 --> 00:49:21,791
So maybe all you lunatics
need to learn

1255
00:49:21,792 --> 00:49:25,628
how to set some boundaries,
like me.

1256
00:49:25,629 --> 00:49:28,257
Well, see you tomorrow, Doc.

1257
00:49:30,050 --> 00:49:32,135
Good luck in there.
Sorry about the mess.

1258
00:49:32,136 --> 00:49:33,428
- "Mess"?

1259
00:49:33,429 --> 00:49:36,306
[indistinct chatter]

1260
00:49:36,307 --> 00:49:37,891
[bell dings]

1261
00:49:37,892 --> 00:49:39,434
Yup.

1262
00:49:39,435 --> 00:49:41,227
- Incoming.
- Head trauma.

1263
00:49:41,228 --> 00:49:43,104
Unwitnessed fall
from the warehouse catwalk

1264
00:49:43,105 --> 00:49:46,399
where he works
as a security guard.

1265
00:49:46,400 --> 00:49:48,109
- Oh, my God.

1266
00:49:48,110 --> 00:49:49,611
Orlando.

1267
00:49:49,612 --> 00:49:52,114
He left five hours ago.

